    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:paragraph:0",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "DNSは入口: HTTPとTLSは別の責務",
          "text": "DNSは名前をIPなどの情報へ解決します。TCP接続、TLS証明書の検証、HTTP応答はDNSの後の段階であり、それぞれ別の原因で失敗します。",
          "words": 36
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:paragraph:1",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "DNSは入口: HTTPとTLSは別の責務",
          "text": "名前解決が失敗するなら、HTTPの404やアプリログを最初に調べても原因へ届きません。逆にDNSが正しくても、443番portが閉じていればHTTPS接続はできません。",
          "words": 45
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:paragraph:2",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "DNSは入口: HTTPとTLSは別の責務",
          "text": "調査では、名前解決の応答、IP/port接続、TLS、HTTP応答を観測として分けます。変更も原因の段階にだけ加え、DNSの問題を広いネットワーク許可で隠しません。",
          "words": 37
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 40,
      "id": "fundamentals.domain-dns:section:boundary:concept:1",
      "kind": "reading",
      "label": "DNSは入口: HTTPとTLSは別の責務",
      "objectiveIds": [
        "boundary"
      ],
      "sectionId": "boundary",
      "sources": [],
      "style": "normal",
      "unitId": "fundamentals.domain-dns",
      "position": 22,
      "remainingSteps": 17,
      "totalSteps": 39
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:scenario",
          "kind": "scenario",
          "label": "状況",
          "text": "DNSは期待IPを返すが、ブラウザで証明書エラーになる。",
          "words": 13
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:step:0",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "手順 1",
          "text": "DNS成功を記録する。",
          "words": 5
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:step:1",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "手順 2",
          "text": "443番portへの接続とTLS証明書のホスト名を確認する。",
          "words": 15
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 18,
      "id": "fundamentals.domain-dns:section:boundary:example:1",
      "kind": "example",
      "label": "具体例",
      "objectiveIds": [
        "boundary"
      ],
      "sectionId": "boundary",
      "sources": [],
      "style": "normal",
      "unitId": "fundamentals.domain-dns",
      "position": 23,
      "remainingSteps": 16,
      "totalSteps": 39
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:step:2",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "手順 3",
          "text": "TLS成立後にHTTP応答を確認する。",
          "words": 8
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:boundary:outcome",
          "kind": "outcome",
          "label": "結論",
          "text": "DNS設定を繰り返し変更せず、TLS段階を調査できます。",
          "words": 13
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 18,
      "id": "fundamentals.domain-dns:section:boundary:example:2",
      "kind": "example",
      "label": "具体例",
      "objectiveIds": [
